{"id":"lendemain","lemma":"lendemain","pos":"noun","rank":1526,"glosses":["the day after, the next day, the morrow"],"ipa":"/lɑ̃.d(ə).mɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f8/Fr-lendemain.ogg/Fr-lendemain.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"lendemains"},"formAudio":{"lendemains":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-lendemains.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il n'y a pas de lendemain.","en":"There is no tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Il est devenu riche du jour au lendemain.","en":"He became rich overnight.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to become","l":"devenir"},{"g":"rich"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"day"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Ce n'est pas arrivé du jour au lendemain.","en":"It didn't happen overnight.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to arrive","l":"arriver"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"day"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"J'ai eu les jambes courbaturées le lendemain.","en":"I had sore legs the next day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"leg","l":"jambe"},null,{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Nous nous mîmes d'accord pour commencer tôt le lendemain.","en":"We agreed to start early the next morning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/25991","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"agreement"},null,null,{"g":"early"},{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[5,7,"for starters"]]}]}